{"id":876,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>岚山风和日暖，社区童趣盎然。7月15日，中北大学航空宇航学院“航心映红岚”暑期社会实践队走进岢岚县广惠园社区共青团“伙伴计划”服务站点，为社区青少年带来一堂集互动游戏、航天科普、科学实验于一体的特色公益课堂，丰富辖区青少年暑期生活。</p><p>活动伊始，实践队举行线下开班仪式，简要介绍当日课程内容、活动流程与课堂纪律。仪式结束后，队员们组织开展趣味互动游戏，孩子们积极参与、踊跃配合，在轻松热闹的氛围里消除隔阂、畅快交流，快速拉近彼此距离，为全天特色课程开展营造了活泼融洽的课堂氛围。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lLzCrinlMfLzUZUImLiUzUaMm-YM8V5VLRMRnm7soznfLzv0gihFp2hmCIa0LYhfoSy8M1y8nRMfM87DL474LN7ZM8LDLzCDM4WRLlMkMlVFM4NDL7l4MRfFM4VRM8lJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMmvsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11677&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3A9464D3A7A63132A87C616672C1CB5A/7960E340/71C7E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lLzCrinlMfLzUZUImLiUzUaMm-YM8V5VLRMRnm7soznfLzv0gihFp2hmCIa0LYhfoSy8M1y8nRMfM87DL474LN7ZM8LDLzCDM4WRLlMkMlVFM4NDL7l4MRfFM4VRM8lJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMmvsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11677&e=.png\"></p><p>破冰互动结束后，实践队结合生动的航天图片、趣味航天小故事，搭配问答互动、案例讲解等多元化形式开展航空航天知识科普课堂，由浅入深地向孩子们普及航空飞行原理、常见飞行器类型、航天探索发展历程等基础知识。针对孩子们天马行空的提问，队员耐心细致解答，用童趣化、通俗化的语言拆解专业知识，带领孩子们解锁蓝天与航天的奥秘，在青少年心底种下崇尚科学、逐梦航天的种子，有效拓宽了孩子们的科学视野。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ln7UrsoRWVn778MIzrRnlCaL7UbMll5DM4AVnRVfMNrfnNl0gihFp2hmCIa0okyZMYyiokyPU4UPMzVknzNYolL4LRNYUzWfnzAfU46kU4MFnzUYU4G8MmQFL4lDnRUJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMmvsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11677&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/887581C4151BE929C3092A2AE8AC7BC3/E42C0466/356D4\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 374px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ln7UrsoRWVn778MIzrRnlCaL7UbMll5DM4AVnRVfMNrfnNl0gihFp2hmCIa0okyZMYyiokyPU4UPMzVknzNYolL4LRNYUzWfnzAfU46kU4MFnzUYU4G8MmQFL4lDnRUJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMmvsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11677&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lnRCrZL8WRLRNiLIzUiM7LiUmlaM7r5VU87ZLznRUmT2LN-0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyDLSyPnkybLmWfoz6kU4N8L7UbLRWVMl-ZUml4nlM7MlQFM4CZMzMkLRfFL4NsLmvJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMmvsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11677&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9611D922A97BC940D902E5B8B53ECD5F/76853B00/39727\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lnRCrZL8WRLRNiLIzUiM7LiUmlaM7r5VU87ZLznRUmT2LN-0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyDLSyPnkybLmWfoz6kU4N8L7UbLRWVMl-ZUml4nlM7MlQFM4CZMzMkLRfFL4NsLmvJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMmvsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11677&e=.png\"></p><p>趣味科学实验环节，队员分组带领孩子们沉浸式动手体验手摇发电、虹吸现象两大趣味物理实验。在手摇发电实验中，孩子们亲手转动手柄，直观观察灯光明暗变化，真切感受机械能转化为电能的神奇物理过程；在虹吸现象实验中，大家认真观察液体跨越高位、持续引流流动的奇妙现象。队员全程跟进指导，适时讲解实验原理、引导孩子们思考探究，鼓励大家大胆尝试、细心观察，让孩子们在亲手实操中近距离感受物理科学的独特魅力，极大激发了主动探索、乐学善思的科学精神。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lMR9rsnNL4o7Q2UImV2MzNsMzfRUNU5inzU8MmLYnRnVUzl0gihFp2hmCIa0MYh2LYyDLSybLzGboR-8L4vYM4f2nlLZMmn2nlVRL8nkoRrFnmNDnllDMzAFLz94MNlJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMmvsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11677&e=.png\" vwidth=\" 357px\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7F361910982437270FEC864FEAC3DB85/F96EE658/1836E\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vheight=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lMR9rsnNL4o7Q2UImV2MzNsMzfRUNU5inzU8MmLYnRnVUzl0gihFp2hmCIa0MYh2LYyDLSybLzGboR-8L4vYM4f2nlLZMmn2nlVRL8nkoRrFnmNDnllDMzAFLz94MNlJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMmvsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11677&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lUmlriMlQRMlWfMImQkUzvbL7lbU8l5DUmNsMRTfLRrkMNC0gihFp2hmCIa0MYysUYy4U1h2L4LYnz7Zn7rkM4rfoz-snz6RnzMfUmNDLNWFMNCYMz6kL7rFLNQkMRNJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMmvsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11677&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/77C3BF332E18DEB75A927E7CE3AB962B/6F257B0E/2FB49\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 351px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lUmlriMlQRMlWfMImQkUzvbL7lbU8l5DUmNsMRTfLRrkMNC0gihFp2hmCIa0MYysUYy4U1h2L4LYnz7Zn7rkM4rfoz-snz6RnzMfUmNDLNWFMNCYMz6kL7rFLNQkMRNJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMmvsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11677&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lMRvrsLzMRUzfRUI8-aM7CsMRvDM875sLNCioz7aMzMVMzL0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyZL1y4LSh2M474o7laLlrRM8CZM4QVLmT7UmC8MzT2nRWFLz9snzCiMzMFM4CZUz9Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMmvsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11677&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/58231F7138E01EC7F876E29DB6459FD2/187E6553/768A8\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 555px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lMRvrsLzMRUzfRUI8-aM7CsMRvDM875sLNCioz7aMzMVMzL0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyZL1y4LSh2M474o7laLlrRM8CZM4QVLmT7UmC8MzT2nRWFLz9snzCiMzMFM4CZUz9Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMmvsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11677&e=.png\"></p><p>在课程间隙的空闲时段，实践队员主动开展公益课业辅导，助力孩子们夯实学业基础、高效度过暑期时光。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lnRfrkM7Ubn7LZLIzMfMRCDMmGPnR75ZM4vZoz6kMRlan7-0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyPLkyDUYy4Um6VM4W7U8M7MzlPMzf7LRCPoz9YU4lZnmfFUmAkM8L8MzWFLllbM4NJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMmvsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11677&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1106C3B7E72DCCD55150D061982C58F0/B8B7C452/1E979\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 283px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lnRfrkM7Ubn7LZLIzMfMRCDMmGPnR75ZM4vZoz6kMRlan7-0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyPLkyDUYy4Um6VM4W7U8M7MzlPMzf7LRCPoz9YU4lZnmfFUmAkM8L8MzWFLllbM4NJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMmvsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11677&e=.jpg\">&nbsp; <img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lMNQrRMmn2UmnVMIzffLl74LR78n775PUlW7Mm7iozUsnzN0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyYMYh7okh7U4C4UzVfLmCPMl7anR-bo7VkU4rfo7QkM8QFMzTRLzT2U8VFMR9bUm9Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMmvsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11677&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C27D8DC63A1A2615A0D298ABC5A8FB7F/59C19FCA/489B8\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 280px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lMNQrRMmn2UmnVMIzffLl74LR78n775PUlW7Mm7iozUsnzN0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyYMYh7okh7U4C4UzVfLmCPMl7anR-bo7VkU4rfo7QkM8QFMzTRLzT2U8VFMR9bUm9Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMmvsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11677&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次活动依托“伙伴计划”阵地顺利开展，兼顾学业帮扶、科普启蒙与趣味陪伴。后续，实践队将持续发挥专业特长，推出更多丰富多彩的公益课程，陪伴社区青少年拓宽视野、乐享科学、快乐成长。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"